jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":562022,"title":"Sergio Leone: cinema, cinema","original_language":"es","original_title":"Sergio Leone: cinema, cinema","overview":"","popularity":1.7123,"poster_path":"/1rlWdxqDcYu8NLuviOu5s0mmCQk.jpg","release_date":"2001-09-22","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.4,"vote_count":8,"character":"Self - Filmmaker","credit_id":"5ec461b528723c0021488526","order":21},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/jh1TMz3AUe40HbCigQ7weCDEW0d.jpg","genre_ids":[27,9648,53],"id":20115,"title":"Opera","original_language":"it","original_title":"Opera","overview":"Betty (Cristina Marsillach) jest młodą i utalentowaną sopranistką. Wskutek wypadku samochodowego pewnej znanej śpiewaczki operowej, bohaterka otrzymuje rolę w przedstawieniu jako Lady Makbet. Według przesądów, aktorka grająca tę postać jest skazana na pech i nieszczęście. Po przedstawieniu, który mimo tajemniczej śmierci jednej osoby okazał się sukcesem, Betty postanawia spędzić romantyczną noc w willi inspicjenta. Posiadłość zamierza także odwiedzić maniakalny morderca.","popularity":3.276,"poster_path":"/nvEtYkLbmAJHTllFDJY2ohoojgJ.jpg","release_date":"1987-12-19","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.754,"vote_count":534,"character":"Narrator (Italian version) (voice) (uncredited)","credit_id":"5efbabe1c5840d00360fe41b","order":19},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/toYJpo6mezPMzO91hWfH8TU6kPF.jpg","genre_ids":[27,9648,53],"id":29702,"title":"Ciemności","original_language":"it","original_title":"Tenebre","overview":"Peter Neal, autor seksistowskich i dość szablonowych powieści kryminalnych o seryjnych zabójcach, przybywa do Rzymu promować swą nową powieść, \"Tenebrae\". Na miejscu policja informuje pisarza o serii bestialskich zabójstw. Morderca jest wyraźnie zainspirowany twórczością Neila. Na miejscu zostawia zawsze fragment wyrwany z najnowszej powieści ww autora. Peter Neil staje się automatycznie podejrzany. Znajduje szybko alibi. A tymczasem kolejne kobiety, a z czasem i mężczyźni są brutalnie mordowani. Czyżby jakiś chory psychicznie fan horrorów? Najwierniejszy czytelnik?","popularity":3.1209,"poster_path":"/AhY5T88mB9yS2WVf5SQTFi0JE12.jpg","release_date":"1982-10-28","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.811,"vote_count":708,"character":"Narrator / Murderer's Hands (voice) (uncredited)","credit_id":"5f09150213a320003576766d","order":21},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/uCBCfEtdezSb8uu5DNkGn4IrFve.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":724677,"title":"Alida","original_language":"it","original_title":"Alida","overview":"","popularity":0.7416,"poster_path":"/oF3inscimRyPrSTfWQNtF8Zl3QN.jpg","release_date":"2021-05-17","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":9.2,"vote_count":5,"character":"Self","credit_id":"5f0f40e51da7a600361554b8","order":7},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/udzceygm3w0tEVKgh7rFsmcIMu4.jpg","genre_ids":[35,18,36],"id":48853,"title":"Le cinque giornate","original_language":"it","original_title":"Le cinque giornate","overview":"","popularity":0.9215,"poster_path":"/nxtg1Lu56N06wCn0XRjgoprDOI4.jpg","release_date":"1973-04-24","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.943,"vote_count":44,"character":"Bandaged Man with Tranzunto (uncredited)","credit_id":"5f31c2e91967570039b04857","order":25},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":741006,"title":"Director: Dario Argento","original_language":"en","original_title":"Director: Dario Argento","overview":"","popularity":0.4797,"poster_path":null,"release_date":"2007-09-25","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0,"character":"","credit_id":"5f58494e5b12400035907bcc","order":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":762591,"title":"Two Masters' Eyes","original_language":"en","original_title":"Two Masters' Eyes","overview":"","popularity":1.0994,"poster_path":null,"release_date":"2003-04-29","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.0,"vote_count":1,"character":"","credit_id":"5faa01b9519bbb003d54f0cb","or